---
import DimsumLayout from '../../layouts/DimsumLayout.astro';
import { dimsumProducts } from '../../data/brands.js';
const featured = dimsumProducts.slice(0, 3);
---
<DimsumLayout active="home" title="Beranda" description="Naga Steam Dimsum House — Cantonese-inspired dimsum, bamboo steamers, dan sajian panas yang dibuat fresh.">
  <section class="d-hero">
    <div class="d-hero-grid">
      <div class="d-hero-copy">
        <p class="d-label">Folded by hand / steamed to order</p>
        <h1 class="d-display">HOT<br />STEAM.<br />SOFT<br />FOLDS.</h1>
        <p class="d-copy">Naga Steam menyajikan dimsum bergaya Kanton dengan fokus pada tekstur: kulit tipis, filling juicy, broth panas, dan kukusan bambu yang baru dibuka saat sampai ke meja.</p>
        <div class="d-hero-actions"><a class="d-button d-button--dark" href="/dimsum/produk/">OPEN MENU</a><a class="d-button" href="/dimsum/kontak/">BOOK A TABLE</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="d-hero-media">
        <img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/j9fy7p_hcpM/download?force=true&w=1600" alt="Xiao long bao hangat di dalam kukusan bambu" />
        <div class="d-hero-sticker">Steam<br />to order<br />every basket</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="d-strip" aria-label="Naga Steam highlights">
    <div><strong>01 / Fresh Fold</strong><span>Small batches every service</span></div>
    <div><strong>02 / Hot Basket</strong><span>Steam only after order</span></div>
    <div><strong>03 / Thin Skin</strong><span>Texture before garnish</span></div>
    <div><strong>04 / Tea Ready</strong><span>Jasmine & HK milk tea</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="d-section">
    <div class="d-wrap d-section-head">
      <div><p class="d-label">Straight from the steamer</p><h2 class="d-title">Fresh folds,<br />not display food.</h2></div>
      <p class="d-copy">Kualitas dimsum turun cepat setelah keluar dari kukusan. Karena itu alurnya sederhana: batch kecil, steam to order, lalu langsung ke meja.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="d-wrap d-photo-wall">
      <figure><img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/idUSfFfqLmw/download?force=true&w=1600" alt="Steamed dumplings di dalam bamboo steamer" /></figure>
      <figure><img src="https://unsplash.com/photos/IhR3WOLuM7M/download?force=true&w=1200" alt="Beragam dimsum dan side dish" /></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="d-section d-section--dark">
    <div class="d-wrap d-section-head">
      <div><p class="d-label">The Naga standard</p><h2 class="d-title">Texture first.<br />Then flavour.</h2></div>
      <p class="d-copy" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)">Dimsum yang bagus bukan cuma soal isian. Kulit, kelembapan, suhu, dan timing steam harus bertemu di satu titik.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="d-wrap d-system">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Fold small.</h3><p>Wrapper tidak dibiarkan mengering sebelum masuk steamer.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Steam exact.</h3><p>Setiap basket punya timing sendiri supaya kulit tidak overcooked.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Serve now.</h3><p>Basket dibuka di meja agar aroma dan teksturnya masih tepat.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="d-section">
    <div class="d-wrap d-section-head">
      <div><p class="d-label">House favourites</p><h2 class="d-title">Order these first.</h2></div>
      <p class="d-copy">Tiga item ini memberi gambaran karakter Naga Steam: broth, prawn texture, dan umami.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="d-wrap d-favourites">
      {featured.map((item) => (
        <article class="d-favourite">
          <div class="d-favourite-top"><span>{item.category}</span><span>{item.price}</span></div>
          <h3>{item.name}</h3>
          <p>{item.note}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="d-wrap" style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="d-button" href="/dimsum/produk/">SEE FULL MENU →</a></div>
  </section>
</DimsumLayout>
